    "intro_narrative": "The world ended seventy years ago, leaving only scorched earth and rusted metal behind. You are a scavenger deep inside what remains of a pre-war corporate bunker. The air is stale, thick with dust, and the silence is deafening. Rumor has it that this bunker holds a sealed vault containing clean water purifiers and untouched medical supplies—a treasure worth more than gold. To unlock the final extraction unit, you will need to power up broken systems, crack old-world encryption, and piece together the fractured machinery left by those who perished here. Time is running out before the radiation storm outside seals you in forever.",
    "narrative_style": "post_apocalyptic"
